OL,4,BPosh chairman MacAnthony 'fighting for 
OL,5,Bhis legacy'                            
OL,6,GDarragh MacAnthony says he is "working 
OL,7,Garound the clock" to protect his       
OL,8,G"legacy" as Peterborough United        
OL,9,Gchairman, with the club facing another 
OL,10,Gfight to retain their League One       
OL,11,Gstatus.                                
OL,13,FPosh's hierarchy had targeted          
OL,14,Fpromotion in 2026-27, but are 22nd in  
OL,15,Fthe third-tier, having finished 18th   
OL,16,Fin the past two seasons.               
